{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026bUDx2OVQqD1792724566.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>將軍澳健明邨一單位大門匙孔，於9月22日下午約5時20分，遭人用膠水及牙籤封死。警方接報跟進後，鎖定一名52歲姓譚男子，發現他涉嫌與全港多區另外9宗同類案件有關。</p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-10-23-10h30m37s083.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026WbZM5dnrDS1792724611.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p>網上流傳一段閉路電視片段，拍攝時間為9月22日下午5時24分。片中所見，一名戴帽男子獨自站在一單位門外，先從褲袋掏出疑似AA膠，緊接竟拿出手機疑似拍片記錄，隨後將疑似牙籤塞入大門匙孔內。</p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-10-23-10h30m26s881.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026tO5WydkmZ31792724626.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p>案件交由將軍澳警區反三合會行動組跟進，人員翻查大量閉路電視片段及深入調查後，於同月30日在油麻地區拘捕52歲譚姓男子，涉嫌「刑事毀壞」。調查發現，被捕人亦涉嫌與8月至9月期間，在將軍澳、觀塘、屯門、沙田及葵涌區發生的另外9宗同類案件有關。涉案男子獲准保釋候查，須於11月上旬再向警方報到。</p><p> </p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T03:43:47.695445+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":320,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T03:02:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T20:18:20.772045+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T03:38:04.778528+00:00","content_hash":"9b1926c5c5de70e1f48b6eda61145eade232120900fec2a9c2e0727b6a158c16","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-23T03:43:47.695445+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}